    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Water is life, yet every drop is under threat. This World Water Day, the Aga Khan University (AKU) is spotlighting the urgent need for water conservation through its annual climate competition, the President's Challenge for Climate Solutions. With the theme 'Every Drop Counts', 16 student groups across four of AKU's campuses will present their innovative ideas and adaptations to expert judges, demonstrating how creative solutions can drive meaningful change.",
